  "display_title": "The Tale of Oshin",
  "description": "Naskaya, the Wolf King, is a fierce warrior and a successful conqueror. Oshin, meanwhile, remains at home, watching as her husband heads out time and time again to wage war. Alone in the palace, she finds herself rescuing an injured salamander and nursing it back to health, feeling that for once she has something resembling a friend. Until the salamander turns into a strapping young man, that is! As a gift of thanks - or perhaps more - he gifts her with a rare and powerful talent, bestowing upon her the eyes of the dragon. For the first time, Oshin finds herself in possession of a role far beyond that of a doting wife… Could it be time for Oshin to weave her own tale?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
